---
source: crates/paper-cli/tests/basics.rs
expression: env.redact(&run.stderr)
---
error: Paper doesn't know who you are yet
  why:  Every save records its author, and neither a name nor an email is set in your git configuration.
  next: git config --global user.name "Your Name"         # set the name saves are made under
        git config --global user.email "you@example.org"  # set your email address
